    "abstract": "Illustrated parts breakdown of the forward engine mount on the CVX-7200 installation, showing the brackets, the bolt set, the heat shield arrangement and the local ducting.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure gives the parts breakdown of the forward engine mount on the CVX-7200 installation, including the heat shield and the local ducting. Use it to order mount brackets, bolts and heat shield items.",
      "figure_note": "The figure applies to the CVX-7200 installation only; the Auran installation has a different mount geometry and a separate figure. That restriction is stated here as well as in the effectivity block, because the two installations shared this figure until the bushed bracket was introduced and an order raised against the old habit will bring parts that do not belong on a Auran aircraft. Item 20 is the bracket assembly supplied with the bushing rework already applied, and item 20A is the heat shield it replaced at that position. Item 30 is the heat shield retaining bracket that comes with it. The bushings themselves are supplied loose against the applicable service bulletin and are also stocked individually for replacement at engine removal."
    },
